Package: bkggeocoder2
Title: Offline Geocoding of German Addresses Using Local BKG Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Offline geocoding and reverse geocoding of German addresses
    using record linkage against a local Parquet/DuckDB database built from
    address data provided by the Bundesamt fuer Kartographie und Geodaesie
    (BKG). This package is a ground-up rewrite of 'bkggeocoder', focused
    exclusively on the local, offline geocoding workflow: no server
    connection, credentials, or data decryption are required. The local
    address database can be built and refreshed using
    bkg_update_database().
